**Last line of the STATUS FILE, exactly one of:** `RECORDS COMMITTED: records/b1089 @ <sha40> | PR #<n> merged as <sha40> | 1 C-entry (C-268), <n> BACKLOG rows, 1 history entry, <0 or 1> catch-up files | Jira: <n> comments (<keys>), <n> tickets (<keys or none>), <n> label adds, 0 transitions, 0 edits | SKIPS <...> HELD <...> | PRIOR WORK section present`; `RECORDS PUSHED: ... | PR not landed (<reason>) | ...`; `RECORDS DONE: nothing to push (<reason>) | Jira: ...`; or `STOPPED: NEEDS TUESDAY` with ONE question.

